      "<?xml version=\"1.0\" encoding=\"UTF-8\"?>\n<TEI xmlns:xsi=\"http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" xml:space=\"preserve\" xsi:schemaLocation=\"http://www.tei-c.org/ns/1.0 grobid.xsd\">\n\t<teiHeader xml:lang=\"en\">\n\t\t<fileDesc>\n\t\t\t<titleStmt>\n\t\t\t\t<title level=\"a\" type=\"main\">Edge Cases: A Synthetic   Paper<\/title>\n\t\t\t<\/titleStmt>\n\t\t\t<sourceDesc>\n\t\t\t\t<biblStruct>\n\t\t\t\t\t<analytic>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<author>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<persName><forename type=\"first\">Ann<\/forename><forename type=\"middle\">B<\/forename><surname>Smith<\/surname><\/persName>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<email>ann@example.org<\/email>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<idno type=\"ORCID\">0000-0002-1825-0097<\/idno>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<affiliation key=\"aff0\"><orgName type=\"institution\">Uni   A<\/orgName>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<address><country>NL<\/country><\/address><\/affiliation>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/author>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<author>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<persName><surname>Doe<\/surname><\/persName>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/author>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<author>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<orgName>No Person Consortium<\/orgName>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/author>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/analytic>\n\t\t\t\t\t<idno type=\"DOI\">10.1234/edge.1<\/idno>\n\t\t\t\t<\/biblStruct>\n\t\t\t<\/sourceDesc>\n\t\t<\/fileDesc>\n\t\t<encodingDesc>\n\t\t\t<appInfo>\n\t\t\t\t<application version=\"0.8.1\" ident=\"GROBID\" when=\"2024-01-01T00:00+0000\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<label>GROBID<\/label>\n\t\t\t\t<\/application>\n\t\t\t<\/appInfo>\n\t\t<\/encodingDesc>\n\t\t<profileDesc>\n\t\t\t<textClass>\n\t\t\t\t<keywords>\n\t\t\t\t\t<term>replication<\/term>\n\t\t\t\t\t<term>meta  science<\/term>\n\t\t\t\t<\/keywords>\n\t\t\t<\/textClass>\n\t\t<\/profileDesc>\n\t<\/teiHeader>\n\t<text xml:lang=\"en\">\n\t\t<body>\n<div><p>Figure 1 shows the design. The effect was rp² = .05 and ηp² = .10 and ηG² = .2, with R²M = .3, χ 2 ( 12 ) = 4.5, r( 45) = .30, dz = 0.4 and BF10 =3.2.<\/p><\/div>\n<div><head n=\"1.\">Introduction to J. Smith et al. Work<\/head><p>Prior work by J. K. Rowling (p. 45) and <ref type=\"bibr\" target=\"#b0\">Smith (2020)<\/ref> found effects<ref type=\"foot\" target=\"#foot_0\">1<\/ref>. see also results reported earlier. This one ends without a stop<\/p><p>and continues in the next paragraph. Data are at <ref type=\"url\" target=\"https://osf.io/abcde\">https://osf.io/abcde<\/ref> and <ref type=\"url\" target=\"https://github.com/a/b.\">the GitHub repo<\/ref>.<\/p>\n<div><head>Nested Method<\/head><p>Participants (N = 40) were tested.   A second    sentence? Yes! \"Quoted.\" Then more <ref type=\"figure\" target=\"#fig_0\">Fig.1<\/ref> and <ref type=\"table\" target=\"#tab_0\">Table1<\/ref> and <ref target=\"#b1\">no type<\/ref>.<\/p><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div><head>Results and Discussion<\/head><\/div>\n<div><head>Study 1. Methods<\/head><p>We used the U.S.A. sample e.g. with 5.5 x 10^-3 values.<\/p><\/div>\n<div><head>Abstract<\/head><p>A body abstract? Strange but possible.<\/p><\/div>\n<div><p>Unheaded paragraph after the abstract-headed div.<\/p><\/div>\n<div><head>General Discussion<\/head><p>We conclude. <ref type=\"bibr\" target=\"#b2\">(Anon, n.d.)<\/ref> <ref type=\"bibr\" target=\"#b3\">(Book, 1999)<\/ref><\/p><\/div>\n\t\t\t<figure xml:id=\"fig_0\">\n\t\t\t\t<head>Figure 1.<\/head>\n\t\t\t\t<label>1<\/label>\n\t\t\t\t<figDesc>The design. Error bars show 95% CI.<\/figDesc>\n\t\t\t<\/figure>\n\t\t\t<figure xml:id=\"fig_1\">\n\t\t\t\t<head>Figure2<\/head>\n\t\t\t<\/figure>\n\t\t\t<figure type=\"table\" xml:id=\"tab_0\">\n\t\t\t\t<head>Table1<\/head>\n\t\t\t\t<label>1<\/label>\n\t\t\t\t<figDesc>Descriptives.<\/figDesc>\n\t\t\t\t<table><row><cell cols=\"2\">Group<\/cell><cell>Measure<\/cell><\/row><row><cell>A<\/cell><cell>B<\/cell><cell>M (SD)<\/cell><\/row><row><cell>1.<\/cell><cell>2.<\/cell><cell>3.<\/cell><\/row><row><cell>x<\/cell><cell>0.5<\/cell><cell>[0.1, 0.9]<\/cell><cell>extra<\/cell><\/row><row><cell>y<\/cell><cell>-<\/cell><\/row><\/table>\n\t\t\t<\/figure>\n\t\t\t<note place=\"foot\" n=\"1\" xml:id=\"foot_0\">A footnote with <ref type=\"url\" target=\"https://example.org/x y\">https://example.org/x y<\/ref>.<\/note>\n\t\t<\/body>\n\t\t<back>\n\t\t\t<div type=\"acknowledgement\">\n<div><head>Acknowledgements<\/head><p>We thank A. B. Cee.<\/p><p>And D. E. Fgh.<\/p><\/div>\n<div><p>Headless acknowledgement paragraph.<\/p><\/div>\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t<div type=\"annex\">\n<div><head>Appendix A<\/head><\/div>\n<div><head>Appendix B<\/head><p>Supplement text.<\/p><\/div>\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t<div type=\"references\">\n\t\t\t\t<listBibl>\n<biblStruct xml:id=\"b0\">\n\t<analytic>\n\t\t<title level=\"a\" type=\"main\">An article title<\/title>\n\t\t<author><persName><forename type=\"first\">J<\/forename><forename type=\"middle\">K<\/forename><surname>Smith<\/surname><\/persName><\/author>\n\t\t<author><persName><forename type=\"first\">A<\/forename><surname>van der<\/surname><surname>Berg<\/surname><\/persName><\/author>\n\t\t<idno type=\"DOI\">10.1000/abc<\/idno>\n\t<\/analytic>\n\t<monogr>\n\t\t<title level=\"j\">Journal of Tests<\/title>\n\t\t<imprint>\n\t\t\t<biblScope unit=\"volume\">12<\/biblScope>\n\t\t\t<biblScope unit=\"issue\">3<\/biblScope>\n\t\t\t<biblScope unit=\"page\" from=\"45\" to=\"67\"/>\n\t\t\t<date type=\"published\" when=\"2020\">2020a<\/date>\n\t\t<\/imprint>\n\t<\/monogr>\n\t<note type=\"raw_reference\">Smith, J. K., &amp; van der Berg, A. (2020a). An article title.   Journal of Tests, 12(3), 45-67.<\/note>\n<\/biblStruct>\n<biblStruct xml:id=\"b1\">\n\t<analytic>\n\t\t<title level=\"a\" type=\"main\">No year article<\/title>\n\t<\/analytic>\n\t<monogr>\n\t\t<title level=\"j\">Some Journal<\/title>\n\t\t<imprint>\n\t\t\t<biblScope unit=\"page\">e123<\/biblScope>\n\t\t<\/imprint>\n\t<\/monogr>\n\t<note>in press 2019b<\/note>\n\t<note type=\"raw_reference\">No year article. Some Journal, e123. In press.<\/note>\n<\/biblStruct>\n<biblStruct xml:id=\"b2\">\n\t<monogr>\n\t\t<title level=\"m\" type=\"main\">A Whole Book<\/title>\n\t\t<editor><persName><forename>E<\/forename><surname>Ditor<\/surname><\/persName><\/editor>\n\t\t<imprint>\n\t\t\t<publisher>Big Press<\/publisher>\n\t\t<\/imprint>\n\t<\/monogr>\n\t<note type=\"raw_reference\">Anon. (n.d.). A Whole Book. Big Press.<\/note>\n<\/biblStruct>\n<biblStruct xml:id=\"b3\">\n\t<analytic>\n\t\t<title level=\"a\" type=\"main\">A Chapter<\/title>\n\t\t<author><persName><surname>Chapman<\/surname><\/persName><\/author>\n\t<\/analytic>\n\t<monogr>\n\t\t<title level=\"m\">The Collection<\/title>\n\t\t<imprint>\n\t\t\t<date type=\"published\" when=\"1999\">1999<\/date>\n\t\t<\/imprint>\n\t<\/monogr>\n\t<note type=\"raw_reference\">Chapman (1999). A Chapter. In The Collection.<\/note>\n<\/biblStruct>\n<biblStruct xml:id=\"b4\">\n\t<analytic>\n\t\t<title level=\"a\" type=\"main\">Journal no year no note<\/title>\n\t<\/analytic>\n\t<monogr>\n\t\t<title level=\"j\">Another Journal<\/title>\n\t\t<imprint/>\n\t<\/monogr>\n\t<note type=\"raw_reference\">Journal no year no note. Another Journal.<\/note>\n<\/biblStruct>\n\t\t\t\t<\/listBibl>\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/back>\n\t<\/text>\n<\/TEI>\n"
